    <string name="settingsscreen_088">"Stability"</string>
    <string name="settingsscreen_089">"Moon Ping, TCP and HTTP answer one question: is someone listening on the port. That "</string>
    <string name="settingsscreen_090">"is not the same as “the protocol works”: a CDN, your ISP’s middlebox or an expired key "</string>
    <string name="settingsscreen_091">"will finish the handshake too, and a dead server will report a healthy 30 ms."</string>
    <string name="settingsscreen_092">"Stability is the only method that brings up a real connection and makes a request "</string>
    <string name="settingsscreen_093">"through it. Slower than the rest, but it does not lie."</string>
